"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="en"><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark"/><style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; supported-color-schemes: light dark; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .ax-body { background-color: #141413 !important; }
    .ax-card { background-color: #141413 !important; border-color: #B0AEA5 !important; }
    .ax-text { color: #FAF9F5 !important; }
    .ax-heading { color: #FAF9F5 !important; }
    .ax-muted { color: #B0AEA5 !important; }
    .ax-trust { background-color: #141413 !important; border-color: #B0AEA5 !important; }
    /* Lot 4 (2026-09-02) — le CORPS des gabarits. Les classes ci-dessus ne
       vivaient que dans le châssis ; les 42 gabarits posent des styles en
       ligne (encre #141413) et aucune classe. En mode sombre, la carte passait
       à #141413 et chaque paragraphe restait presque noir : noir sur noir. On
       cible les descendants de la carte, en !important, ce qui prime sur un
       style en ligne — sans toucher à un seul gabarit. Le bouton, blanc sur
       terracotta, est remis à part par sa classe. */
    .ax-card p, .ax-card li, .ax-card td, .ax-card span, .ax-card strong, .ax-card em { color: #FAF9F5 !important; }
    .ax-card h1, .ax-card h2, .ax-card h3 { color: #FAF9F5 !important; }
    .ax-card a, .ax-link { color: #D97757 !important; }
    .ax-card a.ax-cta, .ax-card a.ax-cta span { color: #ffffff !important; }
    .ax-card hr { border-color: #B0AEA5 !important; }
  }
  /* Lot 4 — sous 600 px : 28 px de marge de chaque côté et un titre de 26 px
     ne laissaient qu'une colonne de 264 px sur un écran de 320. */
  @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
    .ax-card { padding: 24px 18px !important; border-radius: 14px !important; }
    .ax-title { font-size: 22px !important; }
  }
</style></head><body class="ax-body" data-famille="B" style="background-color:#FAF9F5;margin:0;padding:0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0" data-skip-in-text="true">Pick the time that suits you: 15 minutes on video to get acquainted.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border="0" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" align="center"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color:#FAF9F5;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#141413;padding:0 0 40px;margin:0"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="height:4px;line-height:4px;font-size:1px;background-color:#B23F16"><tbody><tr><td> </td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:26px 0 20px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://axion-ia.com" style="color:#067df7;text-decoration-line:none" target="_blank"><img alt="Axion-IA" height="115" src="https://axion-ia.com/email/axion-ia-logo-pill.png" style="display:block;outline:none;border:0;text-decoration:none;margin:0 auto" width="210"/></a><p class="ax-muted" style="font-size:11px;line-height:24px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5E5D59;font-weight:700;margin:12px 0 0 0;margin-top:12px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">The end-to-end AI partner for SMEs</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" class="ax-card" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #E8E6DC;padding:32px 28px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px -2px rgba(20,20,19,0.08)"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><h1 class="ax-heading ax-title" style="font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 18px 0;color:#141413;line-height:1.2">How about a 15-minute chat?</h1><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#141413;margin:14px 0;margin-top:14px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Hello Nadia,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#141413;margin:14px 0;margin-top:14px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Thank you for your interest in Axion-IA&#x27;s network of business introducers. We suggest a 15-minute video call: get acquainted, explain simply how it works and answer your questions. No commitment: you decide afterwards.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#141413;margin:14px 0;margin-top:14px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">To discover the network and what you will be able to recommend:</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#141413;margin:14px 0;margin-top:14px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">→<!-- --> <a href="http://localhost:3000/en/catalogue" style="color:#B23F16;font-weight:600">Our full catalogue of services</a> — training, AI audit, 1-to-1 coaching, implementation</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#141413;margin:14px 0;margin-top:14px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Pick the time that suits you, in one click, with the button below.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="text-align:center;margin:30px 0 8px 0"><tbody><tr><td><a href="http://localhost:3000/fr/appel/apporteur?depuis=email-invitation-apporteur" class="ax-cta" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#B23F16;color:#ffffff;padding:16px 34px;border-radius:12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;font-family:Manrope, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;padding-top:16px;padding-right:34px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:34px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:425%;mso-text-raise:24" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:12px">Pick my slot<!-- -->  →</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:425%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p class="ax-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5E5D59;margin:12px 0 0 0;text-align:center;word-break:break-all;margin-top:12px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Button not working? Copy this address:<br/>http://localhost:3000/fr/appel/apporteur?depuis=email-invitation-apporteur</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class="ax-muted" style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#5E5D59;margin:22px 0 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #E8E6DC;margin-top:22px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">A question? Just reply to this email — it reaches us directly, and a human reads it.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:26px 12px 0 12px"><tbody><tr><td><p class="ax-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#5E5D59;margin:0;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">AXION IA SAS<!-- --> · <!-- -->French company (SAS)<br/>11 Avenue Paul Verlaine, ELITE BUREAUX - boîte 53, 38100 Grenoble, France<br/>Reg. no.<!-- --> <!-- -->108018631<!-- --> · <!-- -->VAT<!-- --> <!-- -->FR51108018631<!-- --> · <!-- -->Training provider reg. no.<!-- --> <!-- -->84381100438<br/>Cet enregistrement ne vaut pas agrément de l&#x27;État.<br/>Contact:<!-- --> <a class="ax-link" href="mailto:contact@axion-ia.com" style="color:#B23F16;text-decoration-line:none;font-weight:600" target="_blank">contact@axion-ia.com</a><br/>© AAAA<!-- --> <!-- -->AXION IA SAS<!-- --> — <!-- -->All rights reserved.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"
`;

